{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21211","headline":"红芍药 · 元稹","name":"红芍药","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芍药绽红绡，巴篱织青琐。\n繁丝蹙金蘂，高焰当炉火。\n翦刻彤云片，开张赤霞裹。\n烟轻琉璃叶，风亚珊瑚朵。\n受露色低迷，向人娇婀娜。\n酡颜醉後泣，小女妆成坐。\n艳艳锦不如，夭夭桃未可。\n晴霞畏欲散，晚日愁将堕。\n结植本爲谁，赏心期在我。\n采之谅多思，幽赠何由果。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21211.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21211","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}